  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "According to the BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/2042326d26ec7b593e52bbbdd22d890b59b1e59f92be81a7235509e9af1c4625.png] \n\n**Option 1 :** **6 and 2**\n\n**Given:**\n\n87 × 2 – 65 + 182 ÷ 38 = 155\n\nAfter interchange the digits;\n\n87 × 6 – 25 + 186 ÷ 38 = 155\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n87 × 6 – 25 + 4.9 = 155\n\n522 – 25 + 4.9 = 155\n\n526.9 – 25 = 155\n\n501.9 = 155** (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 2 : ****5 and 7**\n\nGiven: \n\n87 × 2 – 65 + 182 ÷ 38 = 155\n\nAfter interchange the digits;\n\n85 × 2 – 67 + 182 ÷ 38 = 177\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n85 × 2 – 67 + 4.78 = 177\n\n170 – 67 + 4.78 = 177\n\n174.78 – 67 = 177\n\n107.78 = 177** (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n**Option 3: ****2 and 8**\n\n**Given:**\n\n**87 × 2 – 65 + 182 ÷ 38 = 155**\n\n**After interchange the digits;**\n\n**27 × 8 – 65 + 128 ÷ 32 = 155**\n\n**By BODMAS rule**\n\n**27 × 8 – 65 + 4 = 155**\n\n**216 – 65 + 4 = 155**\n\n**220 – 65 = 155**\n\n**155 = 155**** (LHS = RHS)**\n\n**Option 4: ****8 and 6**\n\nGiven:\n\n87 × 2 – 65 + 182 ÷ 38 = 155\n\nAfter interchange the digits;\n\n67 × 2 – 85 + 162 ÷ 36 = 155\n\nBy BODMAS rule\n\n67 × 2 – 85 + 4.5 = 155\n\n134 – 85 + 4.5 = 155\n\n138.5 – 85 = 155\n\n223.5 = 155** (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\nHence, the answer is **“****2 and 8****”.**",
